@startuml 2.2.10_VVN_List
title 2.2.10 – View VVN Status (by Shipping Agent Representative)
autonumber
actor REP as "Shipping Agent Representative"
participant UI as "SPA"
participant API as "PortOps API"
participant IAM as "External IAM (JWT)"
participant RB as "Authorizer (org-scope)"
database DB as "EF Core / DB"

REP -> UI : Open "My VVNs"
UI -> API : GET /api/vvns?vessel=&status=&representative=&from=&to= + Bearer JWT
API -> IAM : Validate/Introspect JWT
IAM --> API : Valid (roles: SHIPPING_AGENT_REP, orgId=ORG-123)
API -> RB : Check role(SHIPPING_AGENT_REP)
RB --> API : Allowed

API -> DB : SELECT VVN WHERE organizationId='ORG-123'
API -> DB : (apply filters) vessel LIKE / status = / rep match / submittedAt BETWEEN
DB --> API : Rows [id, vesselIMO/name, status, dock?, rejectionReason?, repId/name, submittedAt,lastUpdatedAt]
API --> UI : 200 OK [items...]
UI --> REP : Render list (badges for status)

alt Missing orgId or no role
  API --> UI : 403 Forbid / 401 Unauthorized
  UI --> REP : Access denied
end
@enduml
